# Spec for tools/riscpkg.py: the CJK font pack, from FolioCJK-<ver>.zip.
Package: FolioCJK
Section: Document
Priority: Optional
Licence: Free
Maintainer: Andrew Youll <adyoull@users.noreply.github.com>
Standards-Version: 0.4.0
Environment: any
Depends: Folio
Homepage: https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-folio
Description: Chinese, Japanese and Korean font for Folio
 Droid Sans Fallback Full, for showing Chinese, Japanese and Korean
 text in documents that don't include their fonts. It goes into
 Folio's Fonts directory.
Build-Map: !Folio/Fonts/DroidSansFallbackFull.ttf -> Apps/Document/!Folio/Fonts/DroidSansFallbackFull.ttf
Build-Map: !Folio/Fonts/FontLicence -> Apps/Document/!Folio/Fonts/FontLicence
Build-Notice: The CJK font pack for Folio, packaged for PackMan from the
 release zip on https://github.com/adyoull/riscos-folio/releases
 .
 Droid Sans Fallback Full is under the Apache License 2.0, which follows.
Build-Copyright: !Folio/Fonts/FontLicence
